<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Many spring bids ease.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Many spring bids ease.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Many cash bids for dark northern spring eased Monday in reaction to light demand from millers and exporters, dealers said.</p>
<p>Grain sales were slow at most locations. Pendleton, Wash, sources said active cash sales last week provided farmers enough income to delay further sales until prices move higher.</p>
<p>Montana sources said farmers still have a large amount of wheat in on-farm storage and have been gradually selling it the past few weeks.  </p>
